\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  -2: S$, Ringgit Off Day's Highs \b0\par\par\uc2 298 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Februar 1998\par 10:54\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    Both the the Singapore dollar and the ringgit later fell\par back from their intraday highs, checked by the market's\par caution and a warning from Singapore's deputy prime\par minister, Lee Hsien Loong. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , he told parliament, remains prepared to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market to smooth local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par volatility.\par    In late Asian trading, the U.S. dollar was quoted at\par S$1.6195, down from S$1.6235 at the same time on Thursday.\par    Against the ringgit, the U.S. dollar was quoted at\par MYR3.6525, down from MYR3.7200 late the previous day.\par    U.S. dollar selling in both spot and forward markets by\par an offshore bank in Singapore drove the Indonesian rupiah\par higher on Friday.\par    Nervous that the rupiah may strengthen should the\par International Monetary Fund team currently in Jakarta\par recommend a softening of the IMF's tough stance towards\par Indonesia, market players were paring back their positions,\par explained traders.\par    In late Asian trading, the U.S.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  dollar was quoted at\par IDR9,000, above its intraday low of IDR8,700, but still down\par from IDR9,155 late on Thursday.\par    The Thai baht (THB) dropped back on Friday, however,\par driven lower by fears that the reform-minded government of\par Prime Minister Chuan Leekpai may face a no-confidence motion\par next month, arising from opposition allegations of\par corruption.\par    After the baht failed to break through resistance at the\par key psychological level of THB42.00 to the U.S. dollar,\par market players covered their short U.S. dollar positions. By\par the end of Asian trading hours, the U.S. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  had\par recovered to trade at THB43.25, above Thursday's closing\par value of THB42.85.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  02-27-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0454EST\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916du2r00i30\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
