\par\par \b \uc2  Present Singapore exchange rate policy fine - Hu. \b0\par\par\uc2 227 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Februar 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE, Feb 27 (Reuters) - Singapore Finance Minister Richard Hu said on Friday he though the country's present exchange rate policy was fine and he was comfortable with the current level. \par \par \uc2  Hu was speaking on a television programme discussing the budget he presented on Friday. \par \par \uc2  "I think our present exchange rate policy is fine," he said in response to a question about whether the policy was appropriate. \par \par \uc2  Asked if he was comfortable with the present level, he said, "Yes." \par \par \uc2  Hu noted Deputy Prime Minister and \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore Chairman Lee Hsien Loong had commented on exchange rate policy in parliament earlier in the day. \par \par \uc2  Lee said \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  would maintain confidence in its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market when necessary. \par \par \uc2  Lee also said the depreciation of regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  relative to the Singapore dollar would have some impact on the country's export competitiveness, but it should be limited. \par \par \uc2  He said in most product categories Singapore was not competing directly with the countries which have seen sharp depreciation in their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Singapore exchange rate policies are not mechanically driven by trade weights, Lee said. \par \par \uc2  "MAS exercises judgement in managing the exchange rate, and takes into account exceptional market factors." \par \par \uc2  -- Singapore Newsroom (65) 870-3080; Fax (65) 776-8112 \par \par \uc2  -- Email: singapore.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1998 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010926du2r00zlp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
