\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS-Asian  \highlight22\uc2 currencies \highlight\uc2  up on Singapore budget hopes. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Sonali Desai \par \uc2 806 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Februar 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE, Feb 27 (Reuters) - Most Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose on Friday, inspired by the Singapore dollar's upbeat tone ahead of the country's 1998/99 budget, but dealers said trade was cautious due to uncertainties elsewhere in the region. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar's decline against the yen and gains in several Asian stock markets following Wall Street's bullish performance also helped regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  keep their footing. \par \par \uc2  But traders remained wary of possible announcements from an ASEAN finance ministers meeting in Jakarta. \par \par \uc2  Thai Finance Minister Tarrin Nimmanahaeminda said the proposal of using ASEAN \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  for trade within the group would be discussed at the Saturday meeting. \par \par \uc2  In Singapore, mounting expectations of a pro-growth budget, along the lines of Hong Kong's well-received budget last week, sparked stop-loss U.S. dollar sales, pushing the Singapore dollar to highs of around 1.6100/10. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Richard Hu will begin his budget speech in parliament in the afternoon, but most major announcements are expected after the stock market closes at 0900 GMT. \par \par \uc2  "A lot of stop-losses were triggered around 1.6180 and 1.6150. I think the market was caught a bit long but it seems the MAS (\b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore) was around near 1.6100," a U.S. bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The MAS, \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 's de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to iron out sharp moves in the Singapore dollar. It does not comment on these \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The Singapore dollar was also lifted by Deputy Prime Minister and MAS chairman Lee Hsien Loong's comment that the MAS would maintain confidence in the domestic dollar by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  when necessary. \par \par \uc2  Lee told parliament fears of a sharp fall in the rupiah dragging down the Singapore dollar were hypothetical at this stage and "the weight of the rupiah in our basket is small". \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the government's newly announced measures to develop the fund management industry and bond market were also supporting the Singapore dollar as they would generate further demand for the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "I think 1.6220/30 would be a good area to sell dollar/Sing. We should ideally see 1.60," a European bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  "We're not going back to 1.70 unless 1.64 breaks," she said. \par \par \uc2  The Malaysian ringgit tracked it's neighbour's rise, helped further by gains in Kuala Lumpur stocks and news the government was raising the ceiling on foreign share ownership in telecommunications companies. \par \par \uc2  But dealers expected its rise to be capped by dollar demand near the 3.60 level. \par \par \uc2  The Indonesian rupiah rose through the 9,000 per dollar level on U.S. dollar sales by U.S. investment houses in the wake of the Singapore dollar's rise. \par \par \uc2  But dealers said worries about unrest ahead of the presidential elections and uncertainty over Indonesia's plans to stabilise its rupiah via a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board system would limit gains to the 8,500 level. \par \par \uc2  Singapore's Lee said the Indonesian government had not yet made a decision on the proposed \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  board system. \par \par \uc2  The Thai baht edged higher in slow trade as the market awaited key economic data, including \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, due later in the day. \par \par \uc2  The Philippine peso continued to benefit from a lack of dollar demand, but dealers said its uptrend could hit resistance next week when oil companies are expected to begin buying dollars again. \par \par \uc2  In north Asia, the Taiwan dollar slipped back below the T$32.00 level to the U.S. dollar as the yen shed some of its gains, but its fall was limited. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said confidence over the appointment of new \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Perng Nai-fan, known for his tough stance against speculators, was supporting the Taiwan dollar. \par \par \uc2  Perng said after his swearing-in on Thursday that he favoured "dynamic stability" in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market but would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the face of abnormal factors -- echoing his predecessor Sheu Yuan-dong's stance. \par \par \uc2  The South Korean won rose above the psychological 1,645 level to the dollar on month-end export deals and a surging stock market. \par \par \uc2  President Kim Dae-jung said he would appoint an acting prime minister if talks with the opposition majority failed over the nomination of Kim Jong-pil, whose involvement with past military dictatorships has raised resistance. \par \par \uc2  The Hong Kong dollar was firm and forwards reversed course to rise due to fading expectations of a prime rate cut by local banks. \par \par \uc2  The Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  (HKMA) said it had not been interfering in money markets to add liquidity and push down interest rates, as rumoured. \par \par \uc2  James Lau, executive director (external) of the HKMA, told a news conference recent market liquidity was due to tax payments coming due. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1998 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010926du2r00yzg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
