\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Surge Early; G-7  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Feared \b0\par\par\uc2 293 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Februar 1998\par 02:43\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 SINGAPORE\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (Dow Jones)--Southeast Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  surged\par higher against the U.S. dollar in early Asian trading on\par Thursday, as market players sold dollars on fears of\par concerted \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in Asia by the Group of Seven leading\par developed nations.\par    "Talk of concerted \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is the main\par driving force behind this move, which is happening across\par the board against all regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ," said the head of\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  trading at a U.S. bank in Singapore.\par    The Nihon Keizai Shimbun reported in its Thursday\par morning edition that G-7 finance ministers and central\par bankers will discuss ways to restore the credibility of the\par Indonesian rupiah and other Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  when they meet\par in London Saturday.\par    Topping the agenda is a plan for monetary authorities in\par Japan, the U.S., Europe and Asia to purchase Asian\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in concert to push up their value, the Japanese\par business daily reported.\par    U.S. banks sold U.S.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  dollars heavily in reaction to the\par report, partly to close out existing long U.S. dollar/short\par regional positions, but also to establish new positions,\par according to some traders.\par    At 0130 GMT (8:30 p.m. EST Wednesday) the U.S. dollar is\par trading at 8,750 rupiah (IDR), down from IDR9,000 late in\par Asian trading on Wednesday.\par    The U.S. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is also at 3.7351 ringgit (MYR),\par sharply below MYR3.8201 late the previous day.\par    Against the Singapore dollar, the U.S. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is at\par S$1.6250, down from S$1.6450 late on Wednesday.\par    The U.S. dollar is also quoted at 44.2750 baht (THB),\par down from THB45.4250 at the previous close.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  02-18-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2043EST\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1136 4250 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916du2j00g13\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
