\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dollar Down Late Tracking Rupiah's Early Fall \b0\par\par\uc2 286 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Januar 1998\par 10:10\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--The Singapore dollar has dropped in value against the U.S. dollar during Asian trading on Wednesday, tracking the fall of the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  In early trading the rupiah fell to a fresh all-time low. Traders said that a large U.S. hedge fund was bidding up the dollar against the rupiah, pushing the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  higher to reach a record IDR11,900. \par \par \uc2  The same fund was said to be buying U.S. dollars against other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , including the Singapore dollar, which dropped sharply in early trading. \par \par \uc2  At 0850 GMT (3:50 a.m. EST) the U.S. dollar is quoted at S$1.7615, down from its intraday high of S$1.7707, but above S$1.7555 in late Asian trading on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  'The intraday traders are squaring off their positions,' said a trader at a U.K. bank in Singapore, explaining the U.S. dollar's late afternoon downward move, which has become a pattern in recent days. \par \par \uc2  In addition, he said, market participants remained nervous of being caught long U.S. dollars by possible \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is feared likely above S$1.7700. \par \par \uc2  In the domestic money market, the overnight rate on Singapore dollar deposits has dropped to 0.25%-0.50%, from 2.000%-2.500% earlier in the day and 2.75%-3.0% late on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The three-month interbank rate is at 8.5%-9.5%, compared with 8.0%-9.0% earlier and 8.5%-9.5% late on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  (Tom Holland; 65 421 4800) \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 21-01-98 \par \par \uc2  0910GMT \par \par \uc2  (Corrected 6:06 ET) \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du1l00jve\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
