\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Singapore \highlight\uc2  Late-AM: US Dlr Holds Steady On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Fears \b0\par\par\uc2 239 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Januar 1998\par 04:25\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 SINGAPORE\b0 \highlight\uc2  (Dow Jones)--The dollar was steady in late morning Singapore trading Monday as market participants remain on the watch for concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The cautious approach followed weekend comments from a international monetary source that kept alive the possibility of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said. \par \par \uc2  'The market is a bit nervous, waiting to see if there's any kind of concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' said a trader at an Asian bank in \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The concern is likely to keep the dollar in a range of roughly Y131.80 to Y132.50, with the Deutsche mark shadowing any moves by the yen, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Early Monday, Japanese Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka repeated that the U.S. and Japan will continue to work closely on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy. \par \par \uc2  Over the weekend a source close to Eisuke Sakakibara, Japan's influential vice minister for international affairs, said market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  could reverse the dollar's recent strength. \par \par \uc2  'In New York, 90% of the market is yen-bearish,' the source said. 'When everyone is bearish in the market, it is a good time to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It is possible to turn the market around.' \par \par \uc2  About 0315 GMT (10:15 a.m. EST), the dollar was changing hands at Y132.06, just down from Y132.12 about an hour earlier and from Y132.12 in New York late Friday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 12-01-98 \par \par \uc2  0325GMT \par \par \uc2  1074 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du1c007lp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
