\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Steady;  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Slows Dlr Vs Rupiah \b0\par\par\uc2  By Joseph Rajendran \par \uc2 283 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Dezember 1997\par 10:47\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 SINGAPORE\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  (Dow Jones)--Southeast Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  are\par mostly steady late Tuesday compared with levels late Monday\par with market players bidding time before they push the dollar\par higher, dealers said.\par    Continued \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the dollar against the rupiah\par and a rise in the U.S. dollar against the Singapore dollar\par on thin volumes were spotlights in an other quiet market\par Tuesday, dealers said.\par    Market players said Southeast Asian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  are in a\par consolidative phase now as most traders have already squared\par their positions for the year. But the forecast rise of the\par U.S. dollar will resume into the new year, they said.\par    "The market is so thin that interbank players don't want\par to take calls. They're asking us to come back next year,"\par said the regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  head at a Japanese bank here.\par    \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the Indonesian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to sell U.S.\par dollars around 5,200 rupiah to 5,300 rupiah mirrored similar\par activity Monday, traders said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  "There could be some year-end\par window dressing to make the balance sheets of some companies\par look good," a treasury economy at a European bank said.\par    She added that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's move Tuesday could be\par effective under the present circumstances because trading\par volumes were generally thin.\par    At 0920 GMT (4:20 a.m. EDT), the dollar is at 4,950\par rupiah, marginally lower than 5,000 rupiah late Monday and\par 5,900 rupiah late Friday. Against the Singapore dollar, the\par U.S. dollar is at S$1.6750, above S$1.6714 late Monday and\par S$1.6710 late Friday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  12-30-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0447EST\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1136 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011006dtcu02ss4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
