\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore Dlr Up In Late Trading On Corporate Buy Orders \b0\par\par\uc2 292 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Dezember 1997\par 08:51\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (AP-Dow Jones)--The Singapore \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is moderately stronger on very thin trading late Friday compared with levels earlier in the day. \par \par \uc2  Some corporate orders to buy the Singapore dollar through domestic banks drove the U.S. dollar lower Friday, albeit on thin volumes, said traders. They said there was no sign of the presence of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore, the country's de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in trying to push the dollar lower, said traders. \par \par \uc2  Around 0730 GMT (2:30 a.m. EST), the dollar is trading around S$1.6630, down from S$1.6740 at 0000 GMT (7 p.m. Thursday EST) early Friday, but up from S$1.6595 in late Asian trading Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The movement in the Singapore dollar was sharpest around 0630 GMT (1:30 a.m. EST), when the U.S. dollar gapped lower versus the Singapore dollar. \par \par \uc2  'The market is so thin. There are 20- to 30-point spreads in the Singapore dollar. There isn't much happening except for some corporate orders to buy the Singapore dollar,' said a trader at a major German bank. \par \par \uc2  'There isn't any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  but the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar is probably tracking the yen. It (the U.S. dollar) could go lower, but S$1.66 should be a good support for now,' said a treasury economist. \par \par \uc2  In the local money market, the overnight rate on Singapore dollar deposits was quoted at 5.000%-5.250%, down from 6.000%-6.500%. \par \par \uc2  The three-month interbank rate was at 8.000%-9.000%, down from 9.000%-9.500%, \par \par \uc2  -By Joseph Rajendran; 65-421-4800. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 19-12-97 \par \par \uc2  0751GMT \par \par \uc2  1163 1859 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtcj09rr5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
