\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS-Asian  \highlight22\uc2 currencies \highlight\uc2  sink, battered by won. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Angela Tan \par \uc2 579 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 November 1997\par 06:10\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE, Nov 19 (Reuters) - Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  sank deeper on Wednesday as the South Korean won again hit its daily limit and a new low just as the country's finance minister resigned. \par \par \uc2  Thailand's political uncertainties, which took centrestage in Asia's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in recent weeks, have been upstaged by South Korea's beleaguered won and an ailing Malaysian stock market. \par \par \uc2  Early Wednesday, the won dived to a new low of 1,035.50 to the U.S. dollar against Tuesday's 1,012.80 on news Finance Minister Kang Kyong-shik had resigned amid a looming financial crisis. \par \par \uc2  The replacement of Kang by Trade Minister Lim Chang-yuel did little to lift sentiment, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Also weighing on sentiment was a more than four percent plunge in Malaysia's stock market as foreigners bailed out of the peninsula on fears of more financial troubles. \par \par \uc2  After breaking its key 3.45 level to the dollar, the Malaysian ringgit proceeded to break 3.46. On Tuesday, it was trading around 3.4090/190. \par \par \uc2  Malaysia and the won sent fresh tremors throughout the regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , many of which are expected to test even lower levels within the week. \par \par \uc2  "It is very likely some of the regionals will test lower levels later this afternoon and this week," said a dealer with a European bank. \par \par \uc2  He expected the ringgit to test 3.50 to a dollar during the week now that 3.46, the previous low, had been tested. \par \par \uc2  "Dollar/ringgit is likely to go higher from here because most is real capital outflow from the Kuala Lumpur stock exchange since yesterday. The ringgit has to weaken more," said the dealer at a European bank. \par \par \uc2  After testing 3,500 to the dollar, the Indonesian rupiah was quoted at 3,490/00 at 0445 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Outlook for the rupiah was hazy, with many dealers unwilling to venture a forecast. \par \par \uc2  "It is difficult becasue the market is worried about concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said a dealer in \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the forward market could be under attack by Bank of Indonesia since it came in on Tuesday to drain liquidity from the tom/next market. \par \par \uc2  "But today, the tom/next came in quite tight and then backed off. It will depend on the forward markets," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  In Jakarta, tom/next swap was at 0.2/0.3, while in Singapore, tom/next was at 0.1/0.6. \par \par \uc2  The Thai baht slid past the key 40 per dollar level and was trading around 40.250/350 in the onshore market at 0445 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Dealers in Singapore were expecting it to test 40.750 later on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  "We see customers interested to buy below 40 figure. Eventually it will trade back around 40," a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  In the offshore market, the baht was quoted at 39.780/880. \par \par \uc2  The Singapore dollar was also not spared the contagion effect. It was poised to test 1.6000 to the dollar after hitting a low of 1.5965, where most deals were done in the morning. \par \par \uc2  Elsewhere in Asia, the Taiwan dollar broke 32.000 to the greenback and hit a low of 32.426 compared to Tuesday's 31.770 close, and the Philippines peso hit its first volatility limit of 35.422 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  -- Singapore newsroom (65) 870-3083; Fax (65) 776-8112 \par \par \uc2  -- Email: singapore.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtbj02eox\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
