\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2 /Early; Liquidity Squeeze Drives Baht Up \b0\par\par\uc2 252 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 November 1997\par 03:47\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    "With the authorities on top (of the U.S. dollar against\par the rupiah), the market is very hesitant, but the trend is\par still up for the U.S. dollar against all four regionals,"\par said the head of regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  trading at a Japanese\par bank in Singapore.\par    With the U.S. dollar trading above 3,300 rupiah, traders\par are scared that Bank Indonesia, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Monetary Authority\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Singapore\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and the Bank of Japan will again \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the\par market, buying rupiah to push the U.S. dollar back down into\par the 3,200 rupiah to 3,300 rupiah range.\par    Fear of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to buoy the rupiah is\par also suppressing interest in trading the ringgit and the\par Singapore dollar, traders say, as the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  have\par reacted in unison on past occasions.\par    Meanwhile there is strong interest to sell the U.S.\par dollar against the Thai baht in the offshore market, traders\par say. Although many market participants expect the baht to\par drop further against the U.S.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , a liquidity squeeze\par in the offshore market has forced up U.S. dollar/baht swap\par rates, making it uncomfortably expensive to run long U.S.\par dollar/short baht positions.\par    The tomorrow/next swap rate is currently quoted at an\par implied interest rate of 10.24%, nearly double its level of\par 5.66% two days previously.\par    -Tom Holland; 65-421-4800; tom.holland@djmarkets.com.sg\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) DOW JONES NEWS  11-06-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 2147EST\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1136 4340 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011006dtb702dwv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
