\par\par \b \uc2  Singapore MAS confirms buying rupiah. \b0\par\par\uc2 298 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 November 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE, Nov 6 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MAS) said on Thursday it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to buy the Indonesian rupiah. \par \par \uc2  "We confirm that we have," as MAS spokesman told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  He declined to specify the amount of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  or provide any further details. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah jumped to highs of around 3,260 to the dollar from lows of 3,330/40 on talk the MAS and Bank Indonesia had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in the afternoon. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Jakarta markets while MAS bought rupiah in \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "It was kind of a sudden move...I suppose the liquidity was thin and when the central banks hit the market, the next move was very fast," said Ishak Ismail, market intelligence analyst at I.D.E.A. \par \par \uc2  "They entered at a key technical resistance (for the dollar)," he said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers were unsure of the amount of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "Normally Bank Indonesia comes in in excess of $80-$100 million. But the MAS could have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a bigger amount because the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is large," Ishak said. \par \par \uc2  On Monday, the MAS and the Bank of Japan \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy the rupiah in \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets in concert with Bank Indonesia. \par \par \uc2  Singapore Finance Minister Richard Hu and Japanese Finance Hiroshi Mitsuzuka said in separate statements the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was aimed at correcting what they called the excessive depreciation of the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  They said both central banks would be ready to act in the market when necessary in the future. \par \par \uc2  Traders estimated the three central banks sold between $300 million and $500 million on Monday. \par \par \uc2  -- Singapore Newsroom (65) 870-3080; Fax (65) 776-8112 \par \par \uc2  -- Email: singapore.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011004dtb600mou\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
